  <item>
    <title>学会喜欢冬天，它落下《情书》般柔软的雪【支教周记06】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675f1e0f7d8426f6925359e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675f1e0f7d8426f6925359e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Dec 2024 19:42:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>西吉的一场大雪，让顾老师体验了一把南方人稀有的快乐，也让赵老师学会重新喜欢冬天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下雪，总会让人联想到《情书》中渡边野子仰着头和过去告别的情景，把遗憾慢慢消融，呈现出be故事中唯美的一面。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内含不太重要的顾老师小宇宙头像大揭秘，暗恋史大揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及</span><strong><span>非常重要</span></strong><span>的</span><strong><span>150订阅福利！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【评论福利】</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>留下关于❄️冬天❄️的评论，主播会在节目播出后三天内抽取其中一位送出🎄手作圣诞礼物🎄一份！</span></h2><span></span><p><span>-时间轴-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">1:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">3:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么喜欢冬天，为什么讨厌冬天？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">3:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>全校一起打雪仗、堆雪人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj4e_TK9DQejh8nxkj07W_TFzpkf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>记忆中印象深刻的雪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>关于《情书》和暗恋：下雪天有唯美的be的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a>-End</span></p><span></span><p><span>校园恋爱最美好的是起哄？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-音乐-</span></p><span></span><p><span>情书电影原声带 - A Winter Story</span></p><span></span><p><span>情书电影原声带 - Childhood Days</span></p><span></span><p><span>Conor Matthews - Snowed In</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltt9ls0bsPRLH1nqe9qvxLHmRiC2.m4a" length="37924719" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGvkVSdT9ptsMl38Hh23EpsmYiM.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>四个小东西浅聊好东西之这个电影真有点东西【支教周记05】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6754750017cd5416ad423262</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6754750017cd5416ad423262</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:47:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>标题来自伟大的翟老师，另有几版标题：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>论文标题版</span></strong><span> </span><em><span>寻找属于自己的好东西：关于电影的表达壁垒、悲惨叙事和经验联想</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>正常人类版</span></strong><span> </span><em><span>一部分人的《好东西》？“正直勇敢有阅读量”送给我们的小孩</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>大义灭亲版</span></strong><span> </span><em><span>因为铁梅抽烟，我妈说她不喜欢《好东西》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>金句提炼版</span></strong><span> </span><em><span>现实的内耗是小叶解决不了的，但好东西的力量在于相信明天会更好</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>-嘉宾-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在上海看满场《好东西》的翟老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>和妈妈一起在西吉县城看《好东西》的羊老师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-时间轴-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>给《好东西》打分：是面向有限人群的新东西吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊聊电影里的新人类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1957">32:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2357">39:17</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>聊聊电影里的新关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>小叶恋爱脑？王铁梅“给年轻人一些机会”？邻里关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2358">39:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">47:08</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>月经羞耻竟算得上新话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3432">57:12</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>乌托邦还是当下性？如何看待电影所反对的悲惨叙事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3452">57:32</a>-End</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么是好东西？面对山里的小孩儿，我们给得了他们什么样的好东西？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-音乐-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Screamin Jay Hawkins - I Put a Spell on You</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jessica Pratt - Life Is</span></p><span></span><p><span>汉堡黄 - 滥俗的歌</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmTzpFLLZFmxiEHbzuOjZ0eNR78J.m4a" length="68439789" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoGBdrAsr3U-xEeZ2ouw6I3Kq3Pm.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>山中家访后，我们如何告别固执的揣度【支教周记04】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6730f889f373fe5d4d326c5d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6730f889f373fe5d4d326c5d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Nov 2024 00:36:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>这一期聊聊家访。节目是在一个进县城聚会的晚上录的，四个人来自三所学校，趴在同一张床上，激动地聊各自支教的心得。</span></h2><span></span><p><span>羊老师说：我们共情的方式变了，更能够在了解他们实际的想法和他们实际的生活状态之后，去理解这些家庭所作出的决定；</span></p><span></span><p><span>甜老师说：我从来没想过我会遇到这么好的学生，来了这边后，我们忍不住对他们有所期待。</span></p><span></span><p><span>真实触摸他们成长的土壤，我们目击一场粉碎，关于狭隘的揣度和固执的空想。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-嘉宾-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>来自另两所学校的甜老师、羊老师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-时间轴-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>家访中看到更具乡土性的家庭关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>家访的困难：方言、冷场、姿态？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3013">50:13</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我们和孩子保持了一个什么样的关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3014">50:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3385">56:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我享受当姐姐的感觉，我忍不住对他们有所期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3386">56:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3501">58:21</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我的共情方式发生了变化</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-音乐-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Oscar Peterson - Georgia On My Mind</span></p><span></span><p><span>Billkin - Another Day</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnTk-CERJ-JpgTIenpk6L_a8MpGz.m4a" length="58791115" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpJ3CymtWr3P1twF8e1TBPlVXnSm.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>凑合的信号！为什么爱情可以这么胡闹？【电子榨菜01】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672747f1cbe0e69c8bbd2507</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672747f1cbe0e69c8bbd2507</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Nov 2024 10:26:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第一期番外，聊一聊近期收官的综艺《心动的信号7》，一个陪伴我们无数顿中餐晚餐的电子榨菜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好神奇的恋爱真人秀，从开始的有趣到最后的胡闹，有让我们对爱情思考更深吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>故事也许是精心编排的，但应该可以就着每一对cp来聊聊几种不同的恋爱模式；我们也同样精心挑选了适配的BGM，大家可以当做一个杂谈CD开心地听。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：Centerpiece - Til the End</span></p><span></span><p><span>审判式综艺对素人的伤害，少一点真情实感才是你好，他也好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="747">12:27</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>“高雅cp”：陈柏宇 - 你瞒我瞒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>“毓言cp”：李霄云 - 流沙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>“雨迭cp”：陈粒 - 走马</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>“灏琪cp”：SYML - Wildfire</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2824">47:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>“抓马四人组”：Anson Seabra - Welcome to Wonderland</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2825">47:05</a>-End</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：Carina Round - Walking Blind</span></p><span></span><p><span>底色求同+人格健全，才是心动的信号呐</span></p>]]></description>
