  <item>
    <title>国庆戒断中，还我阿拉善【支教周记03】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670c0a75db2cf82757f11d79</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670c0a75db2cf82757f11d79</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Oct 2024 17:59:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>久等了，这期剪了好久，编辑到这里的时候发现居然有人在等💕</span></p><span></span><p><span>用一句话概括国庆，是</span><strong><span>北上避寒</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>报复性进城</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>国庆截断中，还我假期，还我阿拉善，还我国庆前的乖娃！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmvz298bpV0-pnYXR6SdwYGU2-mZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">1:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>地广人稀的阿拉善有适合国庆的好风景：胡杨林的三千年守候、沙漠穿越与居延海日出</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuu1hOnMvIPIiSqU45fsClDlkdM2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>报复性看电影：其实4D版《危机航线》癫回票价了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl9qA3hAMeD5nS8QAPT7FL54cs_E.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2007">33:27</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>国庆回来陷入情绪低谷，我们在这里到底是不是被需要？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkpCYgEMhWgRUP3-AjyjuOIgFVEg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2007">33:27</a>-End</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么？国庆假期不用写作业的吗？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft42zdpLUuOGDaplKJJahi4Y02eG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>好长的秋天，还是要，向前看！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpf_gNg6cG8l4Cr-LZOnd9uDufyT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>OP：遗忘俱乐部 刘忻 - BIGGEST PART</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：陈粒 - 飞松</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lumB3JTjuPv3i_pqNJ2JH_7aOXsg.m4a" length="37278577" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsgsTtyJ43jTP2zGwEmD4zHhZmG4.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>为了学生，我在月圆之夜变身狼人模样【支教周记02】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66efd70887a9242776fe7f68</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66efd70887a9242776fe7f68</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Sep 2024 08:36:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>两周里，过了教师节和中秋节，学生也逐渐卸下伪装，变得不那么可爱了。</span><strong><span>真想在月圆之夜变身狼人模样，装备上伶牙俐齿，让学生服服帖帖！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一直觉得最近在过一种特别具体且幸福的生活，村味进度百分百。去了火石寨和须弥山，也和西吉的其他支教队员们聚了又聚。上传这期播客的当下，赵老师在厨房里做包子皮，我也要马上出发去捣鼓素包子馅了。Re: 好的，最新消息是皮少肉多，我可以休息了）</span></p><span></span><p><span>上一期我妈的评价是不知道内容咋样，反正两首歌都挺喜欢。那这次的三首歌也包您满意。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">8:37</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>一生可能仅此一次的教师节：对于老师这个新身份，接受得如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span>顾老师骂学生，</span><strong><span>惹到我算是踢到棉花啦</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">8:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>出现新人物，陈老师的教学案例，进来抄作业！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>一只猫的出现又离开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">26:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1982">33:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我们怎么度过中秋？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln1jAFgOZp3ZVftot2528tWm4Ha6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（和赵老师泡茶吃月饼看恋综）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls8EXiqacRqhQfOcWuzuH0j4el_7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（下雨天的山有种江湖感）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqsI7wAgkR5f_wBFlbrXJ489CEMq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（须弥山天路）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn2nacS3AcSLCTa3y__YhXjQLsbv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（在山里看月亮爬上来）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>兴高采烈地给学生过节，学生报之以惨淡的作业。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7CeoUS5NO3SmG6TTeyrCAjwpLZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（给学生做的玉兔葡萄）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>OP：逃亡-孙燕姿</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：一样的月光-徐佳莹</span></p><span></span><p><span>中插：看月亮爬上来-张杰</span></p>]]></description>
