  <item>
    <title>转身向山里走去，没有想象中从容【支教周记01】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e31ac75ca6d0ace388e609</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e31ac75ca6d0ace388e609</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Sep 2024 16:45:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是</span><strong><span>“支言片语”</span></strong><span>，是两个大学生支教老师每周闲聊栏目，努力记录下在西海固大山深处一所九年一贯制学校的所见所闻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>农村学校规模小，有条件的家长都争着把娃送县城里去了。我俩负责八九年级的数学和物理，八年级一共有四名学生，九年级是七名，我俩未来一年的生活就随着这十一个娃展开。</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然我俩每天抬头不见低头见，但还是觉得有一些思考想要更正式地以对话的形式记录下来，认识新环境，认识自己，认识对方，也认识更广阔的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期，咱就聊聊初来乍到，关于异乡人的一场变形计。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>出发！6.5个小时的支教路</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;临行前设想的最大困难是什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">24:39</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>规律的生活让我们重建秩序</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> </span><strong><span>下不了馆子？见证厨神的诞生</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">43:34</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>一周后的当下，觉得自己面临的最大困难是什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2615">43:35</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> </span><strong><span>这一周的经历，值得推荐更多人体验吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-本期音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>OP：宁夏-梁静茹</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：成都-赵雷</span></p>]]></description>
